# A position about how the client moves cards, handed over with Bot1 holding priority in its first main phase: a
# Forest on the battlefield and Llanowar Elves in hand. Clicking the Elves casts them, and the card flies from the
# hand to the stack; tapping the Forest for them turns it where it stands; and once the Elves resolve they fly from
# the stack to the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[Handover Bot1.Pass]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Step = Main1
ActivePlayer = Bot1
PriorityPlayer = Bot1
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
